From 5e62d06201ec84b03c9d3f1453f761f8ab3c60aa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AJ <ajaiupad@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 04:06:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(home): plain brutalist front page at /, Mac desktop
 moves to /desktop

- New Home page (src/pages/Home.tsx, home.css, components/home/*): blue
  panel + white sheet from the Photoshop comp, hand-drawn signature, 1-bit
  Monte Carlo figure (hover readout, click to reseed), work index from
  projectsData with Works/Experiments filter, contact drawer, and a
  blue film section of six frames that resolve from mosaic and develop
  to colour on hover/tap.
- Routing: Home at /, MacintoshDesktop at /desktop (kept eager).
  'Old desktop version' pill links there via the boot transition.
- SiteLayout: / is bare like /film; p5 wallpaper only on /desktop.
- RouteTransition: CRT collapse when leaving / or /desktop.
- Desktop rooms (archive, gallery, feltmoon, lab) link back to /desktop.
- CLAUDE.md + PUBLISH_CHECKLIST.md updated for the new routes.
