+/**
+ * A hand-drawn "AJ" signature, drawn on like arrc.site's scribble over its own
+ * link. Three pen strokes; each animates its dash offset in sequence. Bump
+ * `runKey` to remount the strokes and draw it again.
+ */
+const STROKES = [
